  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  CardPages:
  - The Viceroy of the Serpents welcomes his queen!
  - You didn't live through this time, but snakes used to be able to grow to enormous
    sizes.
  - Alexander the Conqueror deprived us of that opportunity. My father was the last
    of the giants.
  - Alexander erected a statue of himself in our largest city, which holds... the
    skeleton of my father.
  - Could you remove it... please?
  - Alexander said it was important for your officers, but the war is long over.
  Card_name: Viceroy of the Snakes
  LeftChoice:
    text: Remove the skeleton
    effects:
